### ====================================================================
### ORDER & INVENTORY MANAGEMENT SYSTEM - HTTP API CLIENT REQUESTS
### ====================================================================
### Base URLs:
### API Gateway    : http://localhost:8080
### Order Service  : http://localhost:8081
### Inventory Svc  : http://localhost:8082
### Notification   : http://localhost:8083
### Eureka Server  : http://localhost:8761
### Kafka UI       : http://localhost:8085
### ====================================================================

### 1. AUTHENTICATION (API Gateway)
# @name loginAdmin
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Store Token from Response
@jwtToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

### 1b. Customer Login
# @name loginCustomer
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "john",
  "password": "password123"
}

### --------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. INVENTORY SERVICE (via API Gateway :8080)
### --------------------------------------------------------------------

### 2a. List all products in catalog
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### 2b. Get Product #55 details
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/55
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### 2c. Add New Product (Admin)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sony WH-1000XM5 Wireless Headphones",
  "availableQuantity": 30,
  "reservedQuantity": 0
}

### 2d. Update Stock Manually (Admin)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/products/55/stock
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "availableQuantity": 100,
  "reservedQuantity": 0
}

### --------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. ORDER SERVICE (via API Gateway :8080)
### --------------------------------------------------------------------

### 3a. Create Order (Success flow -> Triggers Kafka order-placed -> inventory-updated -> CONFIRMED)
# @name placeOrderSuccess
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 101,
  "productId": 55,
  "quantity": 2
}

### Store created order ID
@createdOrderId = {{placeOrderSuccess.response.body.orderId}}

### 3b. Create Order with Insufficient Stock (Triggers Kafka order-placed -> order-out-of-stock -> OUT_OF_STOCK)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 101,
  "productId": 58,
  "quantity": 999
}

### 3c. Get Order Details by ID (Check status after Kafka asynchronous processing)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/{{createdOrderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### 3d. List all orders (Paginated & Sorted)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders?page=0&size=10&sort=id,desc
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### 3e. Get orders by Customer ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/customer/101
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### 3f. Cancel Order
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/orders/{{createdOrderId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### --------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. NOTIFICATION SERVICE (via API Gateway :8080)
### --------------------------------------------------------------------

### 4a. Get Recent Notification Logs (Shows Kafka consumer audit logs)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### 4b. Get Notifications for Specific Order
GET http://localhost:8080/api/notifications/order/{{createdOrderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### --------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. ACTUATOR & SYSTEM HEALTH CHECKS
### --------------------------------------------------------------------

### Gateway Health Check
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

### Order Service Health Check
GET http://localhost:8081/actuator/health

### Inventory Service Health Check
GET http://localhost:8082/actuator/health

### Notification Service Health Check
GET http://localhost:8083/actuator/health
